From: Michael Tupek <mrtupek@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 16:44:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Fix nfields loop bounds to use ctx.unionfds.size()

Several loops in the LocalQFBackend derivative classes iterate up to
the compile-time nfields (unique field ids in this integrator's tuples)
when searching unionfds for trial/test field indices and when building
union_to_infd / dummy_fields maps. When the DifferentiableOperator
has more registered field descriptors than a given integrator references,
nfields < ctx.unionfds.size() and the target field may not be found.

In Release builds where MFEM_ASSERT is compiled out, this causes
out-of-bounds access (e.g. ctx.unionfds[-1]) leading to segfaults.

Change all affected loops from nfields to ctx.unionfds.size() in:
- derivative_action.hpp (4 loops)
- derivative_assemble.hpp (1 loop)
- derivative_assemble_diagonal.hpp (1 loop)

Fixes bug 2.
---
 fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_action.hpp          | 8 ++++----
 fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_assemble.hpp        | 2 +-
 .../backends/local_qf/derivative_assemble_diagonal.hpp    | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_action.hpp b/fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_action.hpp
index be3e43ee17..f6affd6e39 100644
--- a/fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_action.hpp
+++ b/fem/dfem/backends/local_qf/derivative_action.hpp
@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@ struct DerivativeAction
 
       // Find direction field index
       direction_field_idx = -1;
-      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < nfields; uf++)
+      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < ctx.unionfds.size(); uf++)
       {
          if (static_cast<int>(ctx.unionfds[uf].id) == derivative_id)
          {
@@ -135,7 +135,7 @@ struct DerivativeAction
       shmem_cache.SetSize(shmem_info.total_size);
 
       union_to_infd.fill(SIZE_MAX);
-      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < nfields; uf++)
+      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < ctx.unionfds.size(); uf++)
       {
          const auto id = ctx.unionfds[uf].id;
          for (size_t i = 0; i < ctx.infds.size(); i++)
@@ -145,7 +145,7 @@ struct DerivativeAction
       }
 
       dummy_fields.resize(nfields);
-      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < nfields; uf++)
+      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < ctx.unionfds.size(); uf++)
       {
          if (union_to_infd[uf] != SIZE_MAX) { continue; }
          const int elem_sz = shmem_info.field_sizes[uf];
@@ -385,7 +385,7 @@ struct DerivativeAction
                          num_entities);
 
       std::array<DeviceTensor<2>, nfields> wrapped_fields_e;
-      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < nfields; uf++)
+      for (size_t uf = 0; uf < ctx.unionfds.size(); uf++)
       {
          Vector *src = nullptr;
          if (union_to_infd[uf] != SIZE_MAX) { src = xe[union_to_infd[uf]]; }
